{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19277","headline":"和令狐相公南斋小讌听阮咸 · 刘禹锡","name":"和令狐相公南斋小讌听阮咸","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"阮巷久芜沈，四弦有遗音。\n雅声发兰室，远思含竹林。\n座绝衆宾语，庭移芳树阴。\n飞觞助真气，寂听无流心。\n影似白团扇，调谐朱弦琴。\n一毫不平意，幽怨古犹今。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}